# The consumer-facing docs README links to. npm always ships
# README/LICENSE/package.json; these need an explicit allow.
!MIGRATION.md
!RECIPES.md

# The agent adoption kit (#65). These ship in the tarball on purpose: a coding
# agent working in a consumer's repo sees `node_modules/@zireal/result-kit/`,
# not this repo, so a kit reachable only from GitHub is a kit that never loads.
# `llms-full.txt` is the one that earns the slot — it is self-contained, so it
# works with no network. The skill ships beside it so installing is a copy, not
# a fetch.
!llms.txt
!llms-full.txt
!skills/
!skills/**/
!skills/**/*.md
